{
    "name": "E2E Zoho Books - item, estimate and sales order",
    "description": "Creates a customer and an item, quotes the item in an estimate, turns it into a sales order, asserts each record and deletes all of them.",
    "notes": {
        "57a84c1d-c0d0-4a6a-98e8-ab16d86bf2c4": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 512,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n**Organization ID** `20111141498` is set on every Zoho Books component, including the MakeApiCall cleanup steps (Query Parameters). It must be an organization of the connected Zoho Books account — on another tenant replace it everywhere (List Organizations returns it).\n\nThe cleanup deletes the sales order, the estimate, the item and the customer in that order: an item cannot be deleted while a transaction still uses it. If the flow stops half way, delete the records named *Appmixer E2E …* by hand."
        }
    },
